lanking a sky-bridge, enhancing high-speed parallax. An outer curved neon glass banking wall with speed-chevron LEDs complements the banked bowl. The scene includes a reflective harbor water plane and an enclosed dark vaulted cyber-tunnel shell.\n\n\nThe tunnel design intensifies the sense of speed with strobe reflections from hexagonal laser-light ribs, positioned every 12 meters, and ceiling speed-strips, impacting the car's bodywork. The blinding portal exit, harbor hairpin neon gantries, and brake boards guide the race. The atmosphere is enhanced by faux-volumetric god-ray light blades that add translucent shafts of light across the canyon and the exit portal.\n\n\nThe car's bodywork will have a clearcoat layer mixed with a low-roughness glossy reflection to catch reflections of tunnel lights and neon signs, enhancing visual realism. This approach also covers 22 hero car parts using the `SV_InkHull` method with fading outlines and specific materials for rain lights, brake discs, and heat glow for animation readiness.\n\nThe `V6_09_ComicFX` upgrade includes 14 3D FX meshes, parented to the race rig, with invisible shadows. Specifically, exhaust flames now feature afterburner shock-diamonds, and titanium sparks are designed with clean aliasing for various visual effects.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_board","args":{"since":"31"}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nV6 SPIDER-VERSE 3D MEGA-CIRCUIT ENVIRONMENT, LOOKDEV & 3D ACTION FX BUILDER\\nCircuit : Neo-Monaco x Nueva York 2099 Sky-Harbor (track_data/spiderverse_circuit.json)\\nInput   : pipeline/v4_stage_rig.blend (READ-ONLY, 100% V5-isolated)\\nOutput  : v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_lookdev.blend\\nPreview : blender -b -P pipeline/v6_sv_env.py -- --preview\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport bpy\\nimport bmesh\\nimport json\\nimport math\\nimport os\\nimport random\\nimport sys\\nimport time\\nfrom math import sin, cos, pi, radians, hypot\\nfrom mathutils import Vector, Matrix, Euler\\n\\nPROJ = r\\\"D:\\\\项目session\\\\blender-supercar\\\"\\nIN_RIG = os.path.join(PROJ, \\\"pipeline\\\", \\\"v4_stage_rig.blend\\\")\\nTRACK_JSON = os.path.join(PROJ, \\\"track_data\\\", \\\"spiderverse_circuit.json\\\")\\nOUT_DIR = os.path.join(PROJ, \\\"v6_spiderverse\\\")\\nTEX_SV = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \\\"textures\\\")\\nOUT_BLEND = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \\\"v6_stage_lookdev.blend\\\")\\nPREV_DIR = os.path.join(PROJ, \\\"renders_v6\\\", \\\"preview\\\")\\n\\nos.makedirs(OUT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\\nARGV = sys.argv[sys.argv.index(\\\"--\\\") + 1:] if \\\"--\\\" in sys.argv else []\\n\\nt_start = time.time()\\nbpy.ops.wm.open_mainfile(filepath=IN_RIG)\\nscene = bpy.context.scene\\n\\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------\\n# 0. 读取 3D 赛道数据包 & 构建精确向心倾角正交标架 (right, fwd, up)\\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------\\ntdata = json.load(open(TRACK_JSON, encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\"))\\nMETA = tdata[\\\"meta\\\"]\\nPTS = tdata[\\\"points\\\"]\\nN = len(PTS)\\nHALF_W = float(META.get(\\\"track_half_width_m\\\", 7.0))\\nLAP_LEN = float(PTS[-1][\\\"s\\\"]) + 2.0\\n\\n# 检验最大侧倾点曲率与 bank_deg 符号约定：保证弯外侧一定抬高(+Z)、路面朝弯心内倾！\\n_peak_i = max(range(N), key=lambda k: abs(PTS[k].get(\\\"bank_deg\\\", 0.0)))\\n_pk_curv = float(PTS[_peak_i].get(\\\"curv_1pm\\\", 0.0))\\n_pk_bank = float(PTS[_peak_i].get(\\\"bank_deg\\\", 0.0))\\n# 左弯(curv>0)需右边缘抬高(b_eff>0)；右弯(curv<0)需左边缘抬高(b_eff<0)\\n_BANK_SAME\n<truncated 9893 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"D:\\\\项目session\\\\blender-supercar\\\\pipeline\\\\v6_sv_env.py\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
