e tire contact with the asphalt, eliminating gaps or penetrations. Additionally, the configuration incorporates the addition of a cyber pit-garage row, with skyscrapers strategically positioned to avoid obscuring the moon sightline. To ensure the moon portal remains visible within the identified frame, the skyline ring will be modified to clear any obstructions from skyscrapers. Finally, the banking neon wall will be fixed to ensure the structure is properly rendered.\n\n\nThe curved neon wall's position is on the raised outer rim of the banked bowl at index 974. The configuration file will be edited to replace the undrivable shader with a 12fps comic-cadence driver for the visual flutter effect. Six landmark preview shots will be rendered, including the banked bowl neon wall, to confirm the visual setup at key locations matching the target frames.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"edit_file","args":{"Path":"\"D:\\\\项目session\\\\blender-supercar\\\\pipeline\\\\v6_sv_env.py\"","Replacement":"\"HALF_W = float(META.get(\\\"track_half_width_m\\\", 7.0))\\nSTEP_M = float(META.get(\\\"sample_step_m\\\", 2.0))\\nLAP_LEN = float(PTS[-1][\\\"s\\\"]) + STEP_M\\n\\n# 严格对齐 @track (#32) 的 3D 倾角丝带正交基 (T, R, U)：\\n# P_race_3d == C_3d - racing_offset_m * R，确保与 @anim 轮胎接触零误差 (0.000 m)！\\nFRAMES = []\\n_max_race_err = 0.0\\nfor i, pt in enumerate(PTS):\\n    pos = Vector((pt[\\\"xy\\\"][0], pt[\\\"xy\\\"][1], pt[\\\"z\\\"]))\\n    rpos = Vector((pt[\\\"racing_xy\\\"][0], pt[\\\"racing_xy\\\"][1], pt.get(\\\"racing_z\\\", pt[\\\"z\\\"])))\\n    h = radians(pt[\\\"heading_deg\\\"])\\n    p = radians(pt.get(\\\"pitch_deg\\\", 0.0))\\n    bk = radians(pt.get(\\\"bank_deg\\\", 0.0))\\n    curv = float(pt.get(\\\"curv_1pm\\\", 0.0))\\n    roff = float(pt.get(\\\"racing_offset_m\\\", 0.0))\\n\\n    fwd = Vector((cos(p) * cos(h), cos(p) * sin(h), sin(p))).normalized()\\n    right0 = Vector((sin(h), -cos(h), 0.0)).normalized()\\n    up0 = Vector((-sin(p) * cos(h), -sin(p) * sin(h), cos(p))).normalized()\\n    right = (cos(bk) * right0 - sin(bk) * up0).normalized()\\n    up = (sin(bk) * right0 + cos(bk) * up0).normalized()\\n\\n    p_check = pos - right * roff\\n    _max_race_err = max(_max_race_err, (p_check - rpos).length)\\n\\n    FRAMES.append(dict(\\n        s=float(pt[\\\"s\\\"]), pos=pos, rpos=rpos, roff=roff,\\n        h=h, p=p, b_eff=bk, curv=curv, v=float(pt[\\\"v_mps\\\"]), t=float(pt[\\\"t\\\"]),\\n        zone=pt.get(\\\"zone\\\", \\\"\\\"), tunnel=bool(pt.get(\\\"tunnel\\\", False)), bridge=bool(pt.get(\\\"bridge\\\", False)),\\n        fwd=fwd, right=right, up=up,\\n    ))\\n_peak_i = max(range(N), key=lambda k: abs(FRAMES[k][\\\"b_eff\\\"]))\\nprint(f\\\"Loaded {N} 3D circuit pts ({LAP_LEN:.1f} m) | max |P_race - rpos| = {_max_race_err * 1000.0:.4f} mm | peak bank idx={_peak_i} ({math.degrees(FRAMES[_peak_i]['b_eff']):.2f} deg)\\\")\"","Target":"\"HALF_W = float(META.get(\\\"track_half_width_m\\\", 7.0))\\nLAP_LEN = float(PTS[-1][\\\"s\\\"]) + 2.0\\n\\n# 检验最大侧倾点曲率与 bank_deg 符号约定：保证弯外侧一定抬高(+Z)、路面朝弯心内倾！\\n_peak_i = max(range(N), key=lambda k: abs(PTS[k].get(\\\"bank_deg\\\", 0.0)))\\n_pk_curv = float(PTS[_peak_i].get(\\\"curv_1pm\\\", 0.0))\\n_pk_bank = float(PTS[_peak_i].get(\\\"bank_deg\\\", 0.0))\\n# 左弯(curv>0)需右边缘抬高(b_eff>0)；右弯(curv<0)需左边缘抬高(b_eff<0)\\n_BANK_SAME_SIGN = True\\nif abs(_pk_curv) > 1e-5 and abs(_pk_bank) > 1.0:\\n    _BANK_SAME_SIGN = ((_pk_curv > 0 and _pk_bank > 0) or (_pk_curv < 0 and _pk_bank < 0))\\n\\nFRAMES = []\\nfor i, pt in enumerate(PTS):\\n    pos = Vector((pt[\\\"xy\\\"][0], pt[\\\"xy\\\"][1], pt[\\\"z\\\"]))\\n    rpos = Vector((pt[\\\"racing_xy\\\"][0], pt[\\\"racing_xy\\\"][1], pt.get(\\\"racing_z\\\", pt[\\\"z\\\"])))\\n    h = radians(pt[\\\"heading_deg\\\"])\\n    p = radians(pt.get(\\\"pitch_deg\\\", 0.0))\\n    raw_b = float(pt.get(\\\"bank_deg\\\", 0.0))\\n    curv = float(pt.get(\\\"curv_1pm\\\", 0.0))\\n    if _BANK_SAME_SIGN:\\n        b_eff = radians(raw_b)\\n    else:\\n        # 若 bank_deg 为无符号幅值或反向符号，按曲率方向强制向弯心内倾（平滑过渡）\\n        sgn = 1.0 if curv >= 0.0 else -1.0\\n        b_eff = -radians(raw_b) if (raw_b * curv < 0) else sgn * abs(radians(raw_b))\\n    fwd = Vector((cos(h) * cos(p), sin(h) * cos(p), sin(p))).normalized()\\n    right0 = Vector((sin(h), -cos(h), 0.0)).normalized()\\n    up0 = right0.cross(fwd).normalized()\\n    cb, sb = cos(b_eff), sin(b_eff)\\n    right = (right0 * cb + up0 * sb).normalized()\\n    up = (-right0 * sb + up0 * cb).normalized()\\n    FRAMES.append(dict(\\n        s=float(pt[\\\"s\\\"]), pos=pos, rpos=rpos, roff=float(pt.get(\\\"racing_offset_m\\\", 0.0)),\\n        h=h, p=p, b_eff=b_eff, curv=curv, v=float(pt[\\\"v_mps\\\"]), t=float(pt[\\\"t\\\"]),\\n        zone=pt.get(\\\"zone\\\", \\\"\\\"), tunnel=bool(pt.get(\\\"tunnel\\\", False)), bridge=bool(pt.get(\\\"bridge\\\", False)),\\n        fwd=fwd, right=right, up=up,\\n    ))\""}}]}
